Needs
	5 Prismatic Shards
	100 Cinder Shards

Prismatic Shards
	Before Perfection
		Do not farm
		Reserve Prismatic Shards obtained incidentally for enchanting
	After Perfection
		Obtain Statue Of True Perfection
		Collect Prismatic Shard every day until all enchantments are completed

Steps
	Any year
		Any season
			Any day of the week
				☣️ At start of day
					If Prismatic Shards >= 1 && Cinder Shards >= 20
						Select a pending tool or weapon from the highest available priority
						Go to Forge
						Enchant selected tool or weapon
						If enchantment is not desired
							Restart day
							Skip enchanting

Goal Status							🗹
